Subject: Enable FILC_HAS_FIBER_CONTEXT on Linux x86_64 musl
Policy-Class: P1-Toolchain
Rationale: Fil-C's libpizlo runtime already implements full GC-safe fiber contexts (zfiber_context_new/bind_sigset/getcontext/setcontext/makecontext/swapcontext), previously gated on PAS_GLIBC only because musl lacked native ucontext. With yolomusl providing x86_64 ucontext and usermusl forwarding ucontext calls to zfiber_context_*, enable FILC_HAS_FIBER_CONTEXT on Linux x86_64 musl as well.
Upstream-Status: Upstream-Candidate (Fil-C)
Fil-C-Origin-Commits: none

diff --git a/libpas/src/libpas/filc_runtime.h b/libpas/src/libpas/filc_runtime.h
--- a/libpas/src/libpas/filc_runtime.h
+++ b/libpas/src/libpas/filc_runtime.h
@@ -51,7 +51,11 @@
 #include <unistd.h>
 #include <sys/uio.h>
 
-#define FILC_HAS_FIBER_CONTEXT PAS_GLIBC
+#if PAS_GLIBC || (PAS_OS(LINUX) && PAS_X86_64 && !PAS_COSMO)
+#define FILC_HAS_FIBER_CONTEXT 1
+#else
+#define FILC_HAS_FIBER_CONTEXT 0
+#endif
 
 #if FILC_HAS_FIBER_CONTEXT
 #include <ucontext.h>
